        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/f19dbf/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-20T15:50:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I agree with you Silverleaf about the background. &nbsp;It is rather busy and distracting. &nbsp;I don't really understand why it is 3D when the rest of the game is 2D on top of it. &nbsp;It just seems a weird juxtaposition of styles. &nbsp;On top of that, the moving 3D background will just make it run slower on older devices for something that doesn't really add much to (and in my opinion, distracts from) the game. &nbsp;I would personally rather see a 2D background that shows the environment, is less busy, and matches better stylistically with the rest of the art.</p><p>Other than that, the game looks pretty great.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
